List, inspect and retire secrets

Usage:
  waxseal secret [command]

Available Commands:
  list        List registered secrets
  retire      Mark a secret retired; optionally delete its manifest
  show        Show a secret's keys and where their values live

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for secret

Global Flags:
      --dry-run         show what would change without changing anything
      --no-color        disable colour
      --no-input        never prompt; fail if an input is missing
  -o, --output string   output format: text or json (default "text")
      --repo string     path to the repository (default ".")
      --verbose         log subprocess calls and debug detail to stderr
  -y, --yes             answer yes to confirmations

Use "waxseal secret [command] --help" for more information about a command.
